{"at":"2026-09-28T16:56:14.834Z","tag":"stop","stdin":"{\"session_id\":\"55060baf-6f27-424a-bd92-4cd2e84ab7cd\",\"transcript_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\timsc\\\\.claude\\\\projects\\\\C--Users-timsc-AppData-Local-Temp-tier-agents\\\\55060baf-6f27-424a-bd92-4cd2e84ab7cd.jsonl\",\"cwd\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\timsc\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\tier-agents\",\"scratchpad_dir\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\timsc\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\claude\\\\C--Users-timsc-AppData-Local-Temp-tier-agents\\\\55060baf-6f27-424a-bd92-4cd2e84ab7cd\\\\scratchpad\",\"prompt_id\":\"e12cee16-044d-471b-826f-1ff97598fb91\",\"permission_mode\":\"auto\",\"effort\":{\"level\":\"high\"},\"hook_event_name\":\"Stop\",\"stop_hook_active\":false,\"last_assistant_message\":\"planandtier counted T02 as a failure, even though the worker did the job. Its report came back with a passing check, `greet.js` was correct, and it committed as `e44eab8`. planandtier said \\\"the worker returned no STATUS report\\\", reset the tree to `e465c26` (the T01 commit), and discarded that commit. I checked `git log`, and `e44eab8` is gone.\\n\\nI think the report reaches planandtier the wrong way. The workers send their reports as separate messages, while planandtier reads the completion notice, which says only \\\"delivered to you as a message\\\" and has no STATUS in it. T01's report came back the same way, but its notice arrived while I was starting T02, which may be why planandtier never judged it. Starting T02 before planandtier told me to may also have played a part.\\n\\nAs planandtier instructed, I've started the retry on sonnet/medium. If its report goes missing the same way, T02 will fail again. After one more failed retry, planandtier stops the run, even though the code is fine. If this retry is also marked failed, I'll stop and ask you rather than spend the last attempt. The options then would be to redo the last two steps (`greet.js` and its tests) by hand or to fix how planandtier reads worker reports.\",\"background_tasks\":[{\"id\":\"acbb15c265f6f9184\",\"type\":\"subagent\",\"status\":\"running\",\"description\":\"T02: Add greet.js exporting greet(name)\",\"agent_type\":\"planandtier:sonnet-medium\"}],\"session_crons\":[]}\n"}
