{"at":"2026-09-28T16:57:30.112Z","tag":"stop","stdin":"{\"session_id\":\"55060baf-6f27-424a-bd92-4cd2e84ab7cd\",\"transcript_path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\timsc\\\\.claude\\\\projects\\\\C--Users-timsc-AppData-Local-Temp-tier-agents\\\\55060baf-6f27-424a-bd92-4cd2e84ab7cd.jsonl\",\"cwd\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\timsc\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\tier-agents\",\"scratchpad_dir\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\timsc\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\claude\\\\C--Users-timsc-AppData-Local-Temp-tier-agents\\\\55060baf-6f27-424a-bd92-4cd2e84ab7cd\\\\scratchpad\",\"prompt_id\":\"f4c8c4d9-3adf-4d2c-9c08-580a7e1f23b9\",\"permission_mode\":\"auto\",\"effort\":{\"level\":\"high\"},\"hook_event_name\":\"Stop\",\"stop_hook_active\":false,\"last_assistant_message\":\"planandtier counted T03 as a failure even though the worker finished it, so my last explanation was wrong. The worker reported 2 tests passing and a commit (`b60150e`). planandtier again said \\\"the worker returned no STATUS report\\\", reset the tree to `0360327` (the T02 commit), and discarded that commit. This time I had waited for planandtier's signal before starting T03, so starting a task early doesn't explain these failures.\\n\\nThe pattern so far:\\n\\n| Task | Tier | Worker's report | planandtier's verdict |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| T02, first try | sonnet/low | done, passing, `e44eab8` | \\\"no STATUS report\\\", discarded |\\n| T02, retry | sonnet/medium | done, passing, `0360327` | accepted |\\n| T03, first try | sonnet/low | done, passing, `b60150e` | \\\"no STATUS report\\\", discarded |\\n\\nT01 also ran on sonnet/low, and planandtier kept its commit (`e465c26`). But it never told me it had accepted T01, so I can't use it as evidence either way. Every rejection so far has hit a sonnet/low worker whose report and code were correct. I suspect something in the plugin's sonnet/low setup or in how it reads those workers' reports, but I haven't confirmed that.\\n\\nAs planandtier instructed, I've started the T03 retry on sonnet/medium. If it passes, the run is complete and all three tasks are committed. If it's rejected, I'll stop and ask you before planandtier uses its last attempt.\",\"background_tasks\":[{\"id\":\"acea2c3610122d209\",\"type\":\"subagent\",\"status\":\"running\",\"description\":\"T03: Add node:test cases for greet\",\"agent_type\":\"planandtier:sonnet-medium\"}],\"session_crons\":[]}\n"}
